# Ladder tests gated in CI for the ipu4p variant of the QEMU model
# (IPU4_VARIANT=ipu4p; plan tools/notes/ipu4p-variant-plan.md). Same
# format as enabled-tests (the ipu4 list): one test name per line, '#'
# starts a comment. This variant runs on the IPU4 port's tree
# (tools/ipu6/pin + patches/ipu6-ipu4/), which carries both IPU4P and
# IPU4; each step of the plan enables at least one more test here.

# Static tests (plan P1). Same tree as the ipu4 leg, so these show the
# series still applies and builds on the base that carries IPU4P.
series-applies
build
checkpatch
